asic block or wall block.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rule 3. Conveyor Belt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/6b067eb2b14c4cb72755d3bbbbe548fb.poster.avif?t=1753065762\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/6b067eb2b14c4cb72755d3bbbbe548fb.webm?t=1753065762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/6b067eb2b14c4cb72755d3bbbbe548fb.mp4?t=1753065762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The conveyor belt moves the number block in the direction indicated by the arrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of moves is not counted while you are on the conveyor belt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rule 4. Wall blocks and number blocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/4a50e6d6f7222bc9b31259b001203992.poster.avif?t=1753065762\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/4a50e6d6f7222bc9b31259b001203992.webm?t=1753065762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/4a50e6d6f7222bc9b31259b001203992.mp4?t=1753065762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is impossible to move where wall blocks and number blocks are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you build a wall using number blocks, you can create a new movement path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. level maker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've enjoyed all the stages you've prepared, create your own level,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share it with other users.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An infinite world of puzzles awaits you.</p>","developers":["CloudWhaleGameLab."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/7c10b4a1dd7ebedcde02c05d5bd980145c2e0485/header.jpg?t=1753065762","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3612000/856684/fd5c397acbd21a18825a06dffb94fb4fd35aa198/1750452044/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744472464","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3612000/856684/fd5c397acbd21a18825a06dffb94fb4fd35aa198/1750452044/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744472464","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3612000/856684/fd5c397acbd21a18825a06dffb94fb4fd35aa198/1750452044/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744472464","id":257117924,"name":"BLOCK+HOLE Gameplay Video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117924/8bc3fdeb268f73b497563baf92f1bf716bddc3e7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744472464"}],"name":"BLOCK+HOLE","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"BLOCK+HOLE - $3.99 USD","packageid":1273646,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":399}],"title":"Buy BLOCK+HOLE"}],"packages":[1273646],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stron